00:33:06,864 --> 00:33:15,584
if there were a way for us to do a project this grand and this ambitious as an academic research project, I think my you know, I I'm sort of psychologically an academic at heart.

354
00:33:15,664 --> 00:33:17,984
I would have loved to have done it that way. It just didn't seem plausible.

355
00:33:18,094 --> 00:33:20,944
It didn't s there didn't seem to be a feasible route to us doing it.

