00:34:56,656 --> 00:35:00,256
yes, I think so. In fact, I would I would bracket the T and the M together, right?

373
00:35:00,430 --> 00:35:05,924
So the you know, the technology and the math side, I think, are fundamentally different to the science and the engineering side in the following way.

374
00:35:06,256 --> 00:35:12,420
So if you look at you know what's happened in AI capabilities, particularly over the last two years, maybe year and a half,

